    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR compliance, we standard legal basis for processing personal data is Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest, and we have a Data Protection Agreement (DPA) template version 3.2 available. we also provide support for Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs). our company context indicates that sensitive data processing is not the default, but sensitive data processing can be accommodated if necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For EU AI Act compliance, we has expertise in EU AI Act and is aware of prohibited AI practices. we also have policies in place to ensure transparency, human oversight, and no automated decision-making without human validation." ;
